---
source: crates/krishiv-plan/src/tests/tpch.rs
expression: plan.to_string()
---
WithCte [revenue]
:- Aggregate [supplier_no], [l_suppkey AS supplier_no, sum((l_extendedprice * (1 - l_discount))) AS total_revenue]
:  +- Filter ((l_shipdate >= CAST('1996-01-01' AS DATE)) and (l_shipdate < CAST('1996-04-01' AS DATE)))
:     +- Read lineitem
+- Sort [s_suppkey ASC NULLS FIRST], true
   +- Project [s_suppkey, s_name, s_address, s_phone, total_revenue]
      +- Filter ((s_suppkey == supplier_no) and (total_revenue == scalar-subquery))
         :  +- Project [max(total_revenue)]
         :     +- Read revenue
         +- Join Inner
            :- Read supplier
            +- Read revenue
